      "writtenOn": "2026-03-12T22:59:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Wait, are you returning 0 (success) if the command is something unknown? This is wrong, you should return -ENOIOCTLCMD (it\u0027s an alias for -ENOTTY) if the command is unknown.\nSo, if userspace issues ioctl(ZRAM_ANDROID_IOC_GET_VERSION) before this change it should return -1 with errno\u003d\u003dENOTTY.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 342,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 342,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "f9a7d8c82300c9f36b80e9f17a954b6799032bb3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
